	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"This book is your guided tour through the pack. It explains useful tools first, then opens into farming, building, Create engineering, archaeology and full adventure dimensions."
				"Most chapters are flexible. Split up with friends, compare discoveries, and use the quest lines as suggestions rather than homework."
				"Jade answers what is directly in front of you, while the quest book explains why it matters. Read the block or creature name before interacting; unfamiliar content is often useful, neutral, or part of a later progression chain."
				"A checkmark lesson records that you understood an idea; item tasks verify a concrete milestone. Team progress is shared, so explain discoveries in chat or signs instead of silently completing a branch for everyone."
			]
			id: "7DA1925406767A08"
			rewards: [
				{
