			title: "Welcome, Noobs (Affectionate)"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"Open your inventory and use the item list on the right. Click an item to view its recipe; press U while hovering to see what it can make."
				"If several mods make the same recipe, Polymorph adds a small selector to the crafting result so you can choose the output."
				"Treat JEI as the pack's recipe index: R shows recipes, U shows uses, and an at-sign search narrows the list to one mod. If two recipes overlap, use the recipe-selection button instead of assuming one is broken."
				"If an interface or recipe appears missing, clear the search box, confirm the item's mod in its tooltip, and inspect both recipes and uses. Restarting is the last step, not the first diagnostic."
			]
			id: "381BFADC40CC9BDC"
			rewards: [{
				id: "4DE250BFE0400D48"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 5
