		{
			description: [
				"Use the minimap and world map to mark home, portals and interesting structures. Waypoints save enormous amounts of confused wandering."
				"Distant Horizons shows far terrain as lightweight LODs; it does not increase the server's active simulation distance."
				"Before leaving home, mark the entrance, carry ordinary blocks, food, a bed or sleeping bag, and a return plan. Most early disasters come from losing the route rather than losing a fight."
				"Treat JEI as the pack's recipe index: R shows recipes, U shows uses, and an at-sign search narrows the list to one mod. If two recipes overlap, use the recipe-selection button instead of assuming one is broken."
