		{
			description: [
				"Each chapter is a trail through one part of the pack. Solid dependency lines show a recommended learning order, while side branches are invitations to experiment rather than mandatory homework."
				"Use JEI for recipes, Ponder for Create machinery, and Jade for blocks you do not recognise. A manual checkmark means the lesson is knowledge-based: read it, try the idea, then mark it complete."
				"The pack rewards curiosity more than speed. If a chapter stops being fun, pin a waypoint, choose another path, and return with better equipment."
				"The Field Guide is written as the Chronicle kept by your settlement: practical instructions first, warnings second, and lore last. Complete it in whatever order matches the story your group is actually creating."
			]
