		{
			dependencies: ["18C0AF7F5C17CAB7"]
			description: [
				"Join the same FTB Team before pushing deeply into the guide. Quest progress can be shared, but discoveries are more memorable when everyone understands what was found and why it matters."
				"Split useful roles without locking anyone into a job: one person can map, another cook, another build, and another learn Create. Rotate whenever somebody wants to try something new."
				"Before activating a boss, portal, large contraption, or dangerous structure, tell the group and mark the location. A thirty-second warning prevents an hour of corpse recovery."
				"A checkmark lesson records that you understood an idea; item tasks verify a concrete milestone. Team progress is shared, so explain discoveries in chat or signs instead of silently completing a branch for everyone."
			]
